{"answer_text":"Accurate forecasts come from clean stage data plus weighted or AI-assisted models. Tools known for forecasting: [1]\n\n- **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting. [2]\n- **Pipewell**: Strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Solid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup. [4]\n\nIn short, pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Pipewell if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50d2-738a-b438-90041fa9dc50","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:11.050Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["weighted pipeline forecast tool","crm revenue forecasting accuracy","sales forecasting software comparison"],"latency_ms":5580,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[121,134],[438,451]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[232,240],[468,476]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[325,338]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","se